node_modules
# The committed 50-state bank (E-6): `data/us-states/` is tracked, and is
# reproduced byte-for-byte by `bun run build -- --offline --out data/us-states`
# from the committed fixture — that offline rebuild is what a passing
# `bun test` checks (normalize.test.ts, "criterion 6 — reproducibility").
# Everything else under data/ — ad hoc --out targets, subsets, a live rerun
# against Wikidata before it's reviewed — stays ignored.
data/*
!data/us-states
